        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Solomoni asaba bukesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni aakhola liiambaana lie khukhwaana no mwami Farao owe Misiri. Abukula omukhaana owa Farao amenya naye mu Lukoba lwa Daudi Yerusalemu, khukhwola nga ne amala khukhwombakha lichipi liewe, ne enju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne lisiisi liliabotookhelela Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu baananga chimbosio abuundu aesuta sikila enju se yaba yombakhwa khulwe lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni asiima Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala aloonda kamalaka ka raraawe Daudi, ne kakhali eera chimbosio ne khukhwosiela bibiindu biiunya bulayi abuundu aesuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni acha e Kibeoni khuaana chimbosio sikila ebweneeyo niyo alutare eyamanyikhana lukali yaba. Solomoni aanilangayo biianwa bie khukhwosia eelefu ndala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Kibeoni Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abonekhela Solomoni mu marooro siilo mala aloma ali, “Saba nisio wenya ekhue.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni amukobosia ali, “Ewe wekesia busiime bukali khu paapa wase Daudi omukholi wowo. Wakhola orio sikila akeenda ebweeni wowo mu bwiyikinwa, mu buluungi ne mu bukololofu bwe kumwoyo khwiwe. Ne wachiililiile khumwekesia busiime bwowo bukali lundi buchiililila, khulwe khumua omusoleeli wewe olikho wikhalila endebe eye bubwami luno mu bweyaangu bwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wase, ewe wakholile ese omukholi wowo khuba omwami mu bweyaangu bwa paapa wase Daudi, nakhaba ne siili omwana omukeekhe. Se manyile khukhwamiia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi akari we babaandu bowo nibo warobora, babaandu bakali lukali bakhabalikha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono elesia omukholi wowo chinganakani che limanya khukhwamiia babaandu bowo nio manye khukhwaukhasia akari we bulayi ne bumayaanu. Ne busa, naanu onyala khukhwamiia babaandu bowo bakali bano?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi asangaala sikila Solomoni aaba asabile lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele aloma ali, “Sikila wasabile lino, ne se wesabiile wamwene limenya lileeyi namwe buiinda namwe basiku bowo bafwe tawe ne kakhali wasabile limanya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndakhola nilio osabile. Ndakhua chinganakani che bukesi ne limanya khumanya bulayi ne bumayaanu. Omundu yesi yesi akhabakhoo owe limanya ne bukesi khukhila nibwo ndikho khuelesia tawe, ne okundi se akhabekhoo nga ewe, enyuma wowo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi ndikho khua nibio abeele okhasabile tawe: buiinda ne lukoosi, nio mu bulamu bwowo bwosi mbao omwami yesi yesi ocha khukhwekelaaniakho tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne waaba ne okeenda mu ngila chase ne oria kamalaka kaase nga paapa wowo Daudi ne akhola, ndakhutasa bulamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni asisimukha mala khane kaba kamarooro. Nio, acha e Yerusalemu eema ebweeni we Lisanduku lie ndakaano eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala aana biianwa bie khukhwosia nende bie kumuleembe. Akhola naikara khu bakholi bewe boosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Solomoni akhalaka kumusaango kumuandalafu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio baeeyi babili becha khu mwami Solomoni mala bema ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala khu nibo aloma ali, “omwami wase, omukhasi yuno ne nase khumenyile munju ndala. Mala ese nasaalile omwana niye ne aliio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo ekhola khataru ne malile khusaala, yesi asaala omwana. Khwaba munju fwembi fweng'ene ne se abamo omundu okundi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwana owo mukhasi yuno afwa musilo, sikila amukonela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyokha mu silo akari abukula omwana wase alubeka lwase, ese ne endi mwilo. Amuyila khu bulili bwewe mala ara omwana ofwiile yuno khu bulili bwase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbeele oli siisimukha kumutikhinyi khunuunia omwana, nabona afwiile. Nga namuloleelela bulayi nabona ndi se ali niye nasaala tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omukhasi okundi naye aloma ali, “Khaba ta! Omwana omulamu yuno owase niye. Ne ofwiile yuno niye owowo!” Omukhasi owe khunyoa akobosia ali, “Khaba, ta! Omwana ofwiile ali wowo ne omulamu yuno ali owase.” Nono bayinganila ebweeni wo mwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Solomoni aloma ali, “Buli mulala khwinywe aloma ali omwana omulamu niye wewe. Ne omufu ali owo kundi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami arumania embalu mala bamureerera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloma ali, “Khala omwana oli omulamu yuno mu bitonyi bibili mala oeleesie buli mukhasi sitonyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
