        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omukhasi owo omwana owaba omulamu aboolela omwami ali, “nosiima omwami, mue niye omwana omulamu, okhamwiira tawe.” Aloma ario sikila aaba ne siisa sikali mu mwoyo kwewe khu mwana wewe. Ne kakhali omukhasi okundi oyo aloma ali, “Se alaba owase namwe owowo tawe, mukhalemo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
